    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d88">

                <pb facs="0195" n="89" xml:id="pg89"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wharton to Señor Galindo</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-08-13"><hi rendition="#italic">August 13,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister for Foreign
                        Relations</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Salvador</hi>.</p>
                <p>Your telegrams regarding steamship <hi rendition="#italic">City of Panama</hi>
                    have been received. United States minister at Guatemala has been instructed to
                    make instant and explicit protest against any arbitrary action towards mail
                    steamship under friendly flag.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William F. Wharton</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
